  "findings": [
    "Common.prepareAbilities sets proficient=max(source,initial global save) and creates prof objects. Skill/tool preparation sets value to its earlier effective coefficient while preserving raw initialized value in effectValue. Final field operations start from those prepared values,not raw source.",
    "Final ability value/proficient and skill/tool value do not refresh mod,prof,effectValue,derived totals,passives or initiative score. Fresh skill/tool proficiency continues reading effectValue/current globals;automatic advantage retains earlier prof.hasProficiency.",
    "Current ability score is a distinct header operand. Fresh initiative tie uses current DEXvalue/100;fixed initiative score ignores it. Final scores31/1001/1e9 do not silently refresh an earlier modifier.",
    "Runtime source-score0\u201330 boundaries are unchanged by this qualification. Any later admission of final numeric results must explicitly separate earlier source/derived prerequisites from current numeric fields and finite public representation limits."
  ],
